      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.why, '', [
        'As the fertilised egg implants and the womb begins to expand, you may feel mild, crampy sensations low in your tummy. These are usually gentle, come and go, and are not centred sharply on one side. They are a normal part of your body adjusting to pregnancy.',
      ], []),
