    parts: [
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.direct, '', [
        'Whether you can fast during pregnancy depends on your health, and it is best decided with your doctor. For a healthy pregnancy, a short or modified fast is often possible, but it is not advised if you have complications.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.why, '', [
        'Festivals like Navratri, Karva Chauth and Ramadan are deeply meaningful, and the traditions themselves allow health exceptions. Medically, the main risks of fasting are dehydration, low blood sugar and missing key nutrients, all of which matter more in pregnancy. The first trimester can be a harder time to fast because nausea and tiredness are common, and fasting is generally discouraged if you have gestational diabetes, high blood pressure, anemia or a high-risk pregnancy.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'If your doctor agrees you can fast, keep it as gentle as possible: choose a modified fast with fruits, milk, nuts and plenty of fluids rather than a waterless one, eat a nourishing pre-dawn or pre-fast meal, and rest. Break the fast if you feel dizzy, faint or unwell. Honouring the spirit of the day with a lighter fast takes nothing away from its meaning.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.doctor, '', [
        'Check with your doctor before fasting, sharing your trimester and any conditions, and stop and seek advice if you feel faint or unwell.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'In every tradition, caring for your baby is itself an act of devotion, so a modified fast, or none at all, does not lessen your faith.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'Fasting can be safe for some healthy pregnancies, with a doctor\'s okay.',
        'Main risks are dehydration, low blood sugar and nutrient gaps.',
        'Avoid if you have diabetes, high blood pressure, anemia or a high-risk pregnancy.',
        'Prefer a modified fast with fluids and fruits.',
        'Break it if you feel unwell.',
      ]),
    ],
