      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.perspective, '', [
        'These strange taste and smell shifts are among pregnancy\'s quirkier surprises, and for most women they quietly pass.',
      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.takeaways, '', [], [
        'Metallic taste (dysgeusia) and sharper smell are common and harmless.',
        'Driven by rising estrogen and increased blood flow.',
        'Often start early and ease by the second trimester.',
